# The legacy ASP.NET app is deliberately NOT in this repo.
#
# It stays on disk as reference but must never be committed: it carries a live
# Atlas admin connection string (Code/StructureMap/Bootstrapper.cs), the old
# HTTP Basic password (Global.asax.cs), a working Azure Web Deploy password
# (Properties/PublishProfiles/DartiX.PublishSettings) and the subscription id,
# plus 134MB of vendored NuGet packages.
#
# The rules it encoded are captured in packages/core, with file:line citations
# back to the original in the comments.
dartix-original/

# The seeded design canvas is a 2.6MB generated artefact — the .dc.html
# artboards and canvas.json in design/ are the sources worth keeping.
design/dartix-scoring-app.html
